Canada Civ
==========

This project is inspired by, and is a Canada counterpart to, **usaciv** by
Andrej Karpathy:

- Live site: https://karpathy.ai/usaciv/
- Announcement: https://x.com/karpathy/status/2125779541952246039
- MIT source zip: https://karpathy.ai/usaciv/usaciv-source.zip
- Copyright (c) 2026 Andrej Karpathy, MIT License

This repository currently contains **project documentation only**. It does not
include a copy of the usaciv source tree. Implementers may read that zip for
reference and may later reuse portions of it under the MIT License. If any
usaciv source is incorporated, that code remains Copyright (c) 2026 Andrej
Karpathy, the MIT license terms continue to apply to it, and this NOTICE must
be preserved.

The look of both projects is inspired by turn-based 4X strategy games.
Every glyph, icon, and texture in Canada Civ must be original and drawn in
code. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by any game publisher,
nor by Andrej Karpathy.

